Bundle-Name: Gecko Weather PV Fronius
Bundle-Description: Meter reader for Fronius inverters through the local Solar API v1 \
	(GetPowerFlowRealtimeData): PV generator, load, grid and battery power, state of charge and the \
	energy counter. A PvMeter of type fronius-solar-api for the PV add-on; talks HTTP to the device \
	in the local network, nothing to the Solar.web cloud.

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.gecko.weather.pv;version=snapshot,\
	org.eclipse.parsson.jakarta.json;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.service.component.annotations;version=latest

-testpath: \
	assertj-core;version=latest
